  "body": "It would be useful to be able to put a \"caption\" field with an image, to somehow be able to atomically post an image with some explaining text with it.\r\n\r\nThis feature would be especially useful for bridges and third-party protocol integrations, as for example both Slack and Telegram include this feature, so it would be good if we can bidirectionally represent it into and out of Matrix.",
